    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "LOCATION\n\nLocated 9.7 km east of Westport and 7.6 km west of Castlebar, along the old Westport to Castlebar road, the R309. This is a pleasant rural location but conveniently positioned to access both Westport or Castlebar. The local national school is just a short distance away and the N5 dual carriageway is easily accessible providing access to Castlebar and beyond. The surrounding area comprises mainly of rural farmlands with some local one off houses.\n \nCastlebar is the county town of Mayo with an excellent range of retail, business and leisure amenities, it is well connected with road and rail infrastructure being on the N5, N60 and N84 and benefitting from regular train services to Dublin. Knock airport is 40 minutes away.\n\nDESCRIPTION\n \nProperty comprises of a detached modest 3 bedroom bungalow of standard rendered concrete block construction with mainly single glazed teak windows but some windows have been replaced with uPVC double glazed windows, all under a concrete tiled roof. Extending to c.90 sq. m. the property has been vacant for about a year requires refurbishment. To the front entrance of the property is a disabled ramp access with handrail.\n \nThe property is located on a triangular site extending to 0.2 HA (0.49 a). The property sits behind rendered concrete block walls and steel gates over a concrete drive. There is front, rear and side lawns and there is an attached garage.\n\nFEATURES:\n\n•Conveniently located to Castlebar & Westport\n•Comprises detached 3 Bedroom Bungalow\n•In need of refurbishment\n•Extends to c.90 sq. m (968.75 sq ft) with attached garage\n•Ideal refurbishment opportunity which may qualify for grants for eligible parties\n\nSERVICES\n\nWater Mains\nSewerage On site septic tank\nElectricity Mains\nHeating Oil fired central heating\n \nTITLE\n\nThe property has a registered freehold title held within Folio No. MY25049F\n\n\nBER: G -119652048\n\n\nACCOMMODATION COMPRISES: \n \nGROUND FLOOR\n\nENTRANCE HALL:0.87m x 5.67m\nPlastered and painted walls, floating timber floor\n\nLIVING ROOM:4.88m x 3.95m\nCarpeted floor, plastered and painted walls, brick-built open fireplace\n\nKITCHEN:3.81m x 3.33m\nLino floor, shaker-style timber units, Formica worktop, stainless steel sink\n\nBEDROOM (1):3.28m x 4.5m\nPlastered and painted walls, floating timber floor\n\nBEDROOM (2):1.94m x 3.78m\nPlastered and painted walls, floating timber floor\n\nBEDROOM (3):3.46m x 2.41m\nCarpeted floor, plastered and painted walls\n\nBATHROOM:2.0m x 2.41m\nTiled floor, tiled walls, wet area with electric shower, wc, heated towel rail, extractor heater, wall mounted mirror, whb\n\nASKING PRICE 255,000\n\nVIEWINGS\n\nStrictly by appointment. Please contact O'Toole & Co. on 098 28000 or info@tot.ie.\n\nDIRECTIONS\n\nLocated 9.7 km east of Westport and 7.6 km west of Castlebar, along the old Westport to Castlebar road (R309). Follow google maps directions for Eircode F23 V996"
